I was succesfully see Create password form
    I was input valid data until Address confirmation page, and click "lanjutkan" button

the page is showing Create Password form again
    AppiumLibrary.Wait Until Element Is Visible    //android.widget.TextView[@text="Buat Password"]
    Sleep    1s

I fill invalid data in "Password" field "${password}"
   ${locator}    Set Variable    //android.widget.EditText[@resource-id="textfield_page_pendaftaran_password"]    #/android.view.View[2]
    AppiumLibrary.Click Element    ${locator}
    AppiumLibrary.Input Text    ${locator}    ${password}
    Sleep    1s    

I fill invalid data in "Ulangi Password" field "${confirm_pswd}"
  ${locator}    Set Variable    //android.widget.EditText[@resource-id="textfield_page_pendaftaran_confirm_password"]    #/android.view.View[2]
    AppiumLibrary.Click Element    ${locator}
    AppiumLibrary.Input Text    ${locator}    ${confirm_pswd}
    Sleep    1s

I should see activated button "Lanjutkan" in form
    AppiumLibrary.Wait Until Element Is Visible    //android.view.View[@resource-id="button_page_password_lanjutkan"]/android.widget.Button

I click button "Lanjutkan" in form
    AppiumLibrary.Click Element    //android.view.View[@resource-id="button_page_password_lanjutkan"]/android.widget.Button
    Sleep    1s

I should see error message notification "${err_msg}"
   Run Keyword If    '${err_msg}' == 'Validasi1'    AppiumLibrary.Wait Until Page Contains Element    //android.widget.TextView[@text="Password harus mengandung setidaknya satu huruf dan satu angka."]    5s 
    ...     ELSE IF  '${err_msg}' == 'Validasi2'    AppiumLibrary.Wait Until Page Contains Element    //android.widget.TextView[@text="Password tidak cocok."]    5s
